    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/aca8c822a5bd2d49ba62a892dc975a03.poster.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/aca8c822a5bd2d49ba62a892dc975a03.webm?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/aca8c822a5bd2d49ba62a892dc975a03.mp4?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is CHARRUA SOCCER!, with the same action and adrenaline that you already know from the Pro Edition, in this edition, you can face other players in Mirror Online matches!<br>Mirror Online? yes! this is something new in football games\u2026 two simultaneous matches, one overall score! Control your local team and direct your remote team. The combined goals decide the winner!<br><br>A ranked game mode, in which while you directly control your local team, another version of your team, playing as the visitor, faces the opponent on the remote PC, following the strategy you define in advance. Both players will be aware of what happens in the remote match, even being able to view the replays of the best moments from each game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/f841158eec4a3225c70f787e3bdc1bea.poster.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/f841158eec4a3225c70f787e3bdc1bea.webm?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/f841158eec4a3225c70f787e3bdc1bea.mp4?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Create and lead your team to glory, competing in ranked mode or playing with friends.<br>You can face your rivals alone or if you wish, you can even invite friends to play on the same team, a feature available by connecting locally or through Steam Remote Together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mirror Online:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/a73416dadd7da90014658b27c5152e12.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=256 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An original mode- a new way to play and compete against remote opponents.<br></li><li> Two Matches Simultaneously- Home and away games, with remote match event alerts!<br></li><li> Control your home team- you face the rival team under the direction of your opponent.<br></li><li> Manage your remote team- with your direction, your team will play against the rival.<br></li><li> Evolve your team- by playing you will get XP to improve your stats.<br></li><li> Ranked Leagues- start at the bottom and lead your team to compete among the best.<br></li><li> Ranked Matches- find an opponent with similar skills to play mirror online.<br></li><li> Friendly Matches- play Mirror Online matches against a friend.<br></li><li> Cooperative Matches- invite your friends to join your team to face rivals. The connection of these friends can be local or through Remote Play Together. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Store:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/5b43b4b0f0d9c3adc01c808398fc4ea8.poster.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/5b43b4b0f0d9c3adc01c808398fc4ea8.webm?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/5b43b4b0f0d9c3adc01c808398fc4ea8.mp4?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Earn coins as you play to buy cool items in the store, like custom balls, flags, stadiums, and player cosmetics \u2013 think unique hairdos to dog costumes. The possibilities are endless!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Link with the PRO Edition:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/7ce9937b6564aa4eeec0f64dfcece8f0.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=256 /></span><br>Those who already own or plan to purchase the Pro Edition will also benefit from accessing their thematic items, stadiums, balls, etc., in Mirror Edition as well.<br>The Mirror and Pro versions are linked, the coins earned in both editions are unified, as are the items purchased in either store. That is, if you need coins for an item that you want to buy in the Mirror store, you can also collect coins by playing the various game modes available in the Pro edition.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/45a7f9f49a6ab48144ba2b320a09a220.poster.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/45a7f9f49a6ab48144ba2b320a09a220.webm?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/45a7f9f49a6ab48144ba2b320a09a220.mp4?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Intuitive yet challenging gameplay, perfect for all skill levels.<br></li><li> Dual control modes cater to both casual and seasoned players.<br></li><li> Customizable assistance \u2013 turn it on for help or off for a tougher challenge.<br></li><li> Realistic soccer elements: fouls, cards, injuries, penalties.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/eea95c612f9145b5a3c48e6c60158933.poster.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/eea95c612f9145b5a3c48e6c60158933.webm?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/eea95c612f9145b5a3c48e6c60158933.mp4?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Options for women's, men's, and mixed teams.<br></li><li> Variety of moves: passes, shots, and specialty skills like Chilean kicks.<br></li><li> In-depth team management: formation, strategy, substitutions, and more.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/9136ff861a75d1b7df595fbfc2fbdf96.poster.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/9136ff861a75d1b7df595fbfc2fbdf96.webm?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/9136ff861a75d1b7df595fbfc2fbdf96.mp4?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The Mirror Edition promises endless entertainment!<br>Are you prepared to challenge friends or fight for the title of ultimate champion?</strong>",
