ouls, cards, injuries, penalties.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/eea95c612f9145b5a3c48e6c60158933.poster.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/eea95c612f9145b5a3c48e6c60158933.webm?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/eea95c612f9145b5a3c48e6c60158933.mp4?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Options for women's, men's, and mixed teams.<br></li><li> Variety of moves: passes, shots, and specialty skills like Chilean kicks.<br></li><li> In-depth team management: formation, strategy, substitutions, and more.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/9136ff861a75d1b7df595fbfc2fbdf96.poster.avif?t=1711210521\" width=602 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/9136ff861a75d1b7df595fbfc2fbdf96.webm?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726240/extras/9136ff861a75d1b7df595fbfc2fbdf96.mp4?t=1711210521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The Mirror Edition promises endless entertainment!<br>Are you prepared to challenge friends or fight for the title of ultimate champion?</strong>",
